Woody Woodpecker Goes to Camp is a 2024 American live-action animated slapstick comedy film directed by Jon Rosenbaum (in his feature directorial debut) and
produced by Jon Kuyper, from a screenplay written by Jim Martin, Cory Edwards, and Stephen Mazur, and a story conceived by Mazur and Edwards.

